{"id":"vod_sn_36701","vodId":"36701","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法老师第一季","name_cn":"魔法老师第一季","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c24459cce37f06aeb0e970ca4de7b187.jpg"},"summary":"虽然涅吉（佐藤利奈 配音）只有10岁，但他强大的魔法能力使得他足以担负起任教麻帆良学院的重任，只是，性格有些害羞又未经人事的涅吉，要他面对班上31名年长且清纯可爱的女生，这样真的没问题吗？　　每一个魔法使的身边，都会存在一个保护大的勇士，两人之间要签订契约，生死与共。而一直没有勇士相伴的涅吉，居然在阴差阳错之下，和自己的学生，巨力系少女神乐坂明日菜（神田朱未 配音）签订了契约。除此之外，情报通朝仓和美（笹川亚矢奈 配音），文学少女绫濑夕映（桑谷夏子 配音），阴阳师近卫木乃香（近卫木乃香 配音），这些女孩子们的出现，也为涅吉惊险刺激的生活增添了一份欢乐。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:45:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bB0cBd6FRZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ydbZXtT9Ma1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3nUnqhcWEV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LbvD3Yz1iK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6sGzgh0Pvu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VeXe2LX8Lt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jVJbrrsLLb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vu2ewxe1Fe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KpERqvrg8x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QTDyngYGS51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wgcSnQCe9H1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Ns4SbyBPgp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8anuZrZKVU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G8sbbAPTF21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","u